<title>BULGARIA: BULGARIA JULY INFLATION ACCELERATES TO 3.7 PCT.</title>
<headline>BULGARIA JULY INFLATION ACCELERATES TO 3.7 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bulgaria's July consumer price inflation accelerated to 3.7 percent from 0.8 percent in June, the National Statistics Institute (NSI) said on Monday.</p>
<p>Cumulative inflation for the first seven months was 505.6 percent. A year-on-year inflation figure for July will be available later this month.</p>
</text>
